  "title": "Asian Lettuce Wraps",
  "description": "These lettuce wraps are filled with saucy, gingery beef. Super easy to make and bursting with Asian flavors — they make a fun appetizer to share!",
  "authors": [
    "Rachel Castro"
  ],
  "date_published": "2004-04-17T09:44:31-04:00",
